<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
    Layer panel - selected layer viewer and editor in the default Viewer dock group.

    Static-layout capture of src/ui/LayerPanel.cpp (constructor: stacked
    pageLayer with breadcrumb + preview + form editor; pageNoLayer placeholder).
    Object names are the reference ones; all field values are bound at runtime.

    Connected through setupUi() in the corresponding panel constructor;
    the form is included in both CMake and qmake. See ui/panels/README.md.
-->
